
  Install the tool with your      
  package manager.                
                                  
  npm · bun · pnpm                
                                  
  ▸ npm ──────────────────────────
  npm i jq                        
                                  
  ▸ bun ──────────────────────────
  bun add jq                      
                                  
  ▸ pnpm ─────────────────────────
  pnpm add jq                     
                                  
  | NOTE                          
  |                               
  | pnpm needs a lock file.       
                                  
  --------                        
                                  
  Pick the one your project uses. 
                                  
  Rule before a deeper heading    
                                  
  ▸ Rule before a deeper heading ─
  One.                            
                                  
  --------                        
                                  
  #### Not a tab                  
                                  
  Two.                            

